<title>USA: Georgia Gulf Q4 shr falls.</title>
<headline>Georgia Gulf Q4 shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended   Year Ended</p>
<p>				    December 31,     December 31,</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net sales		$218,817  $220,840  $896,186 $1,081,576</p>
<p> Net income		 16,657    31,062    71,620    186,494</p>
<p>Net income per common share</p>
<p>				  0.48	0.82	1.97	 4.73</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>shares and equivalents</p>
<p>   outstanding	    34,948    38,098    36,288     39,428</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings for the fourth quarter of 1996 include a favorable settlement of an insurance claim for $3.2 million and a reduction of an environmental tax liability by $4.0 million. These item decreased cost of sales and resulted in an increase to  net income of about $4.5 million or $0.13 a share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
